alwaysApply: true
rules:
  - |
    ## Docs rule (short, complete)
    - Source of truth: `AGENTS.md` (docs policy + action structure).
    - Never edit generated outputs: `docs/**`, `<action>/README.md`, or the root `README.md` section between `<!-- LATEST_TAGS_START -->` and `<!-- LATEST_TAGS_END -->`.
    - Hand-written action docs go only in `<action>/DOCS.md` (narrative/gotchas). Avoid H1 (`# ...`) headings.
    - Do not duplicate generated sections in `DOCS.md` (title/description, quick usage snippet, inputs/outputs tables, `runs.*` technical info, referenced actions, files list, other versions links).
    - If docs must change: change `action.yml` or `<action>/DOCS.md`; for format/structure changes, change `.github/workflows/scripts/generate_action_docs.py` (ask first).

